{"3536500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tunguska 2: Whitefall", "steam_appid": 3536500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tunguska 2: Whitefall is a work-in-progress sequel to top-down survival RPG Tunguska: The Visitation. This new adventure takes you to a new sector of the Exclusion Zone affected by Whitefall - a snow-like substance that swallows energy and bridges the Zone to higher dimensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revisit familiar faces from the First Generation, who have travelled deeper into the Zone searching for a better prospect: extracting artifacts from higher dimensions during Whitefall events in exchange for money, fame, and tickets to &quot;paradise&quot;. Will they succeed, and what dark secrets will be revealed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned Features (evolving):</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arsenal of manufactured weapons from Warsaw Pact and NATO</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arsenal of makeshift weapons that can be customized and upgraded</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple companion system with item-sharing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded skills system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded survival stats including body heat management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded crafting</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tunguska 2: Whitefall is a work-in-progress sequel to top-down survival RPG Tunguska: The Visitation. This new adventure takes you to a new sector of the Exclusion Zone affected by Whitefall - a snow-like substance that swallows energy and bridges the Zone to higher dimensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revisit familiar faces from the First Generation, who have travelled deeper into the Zone searching for a better prospect: extracting artifacts from higher dimensions during Whitefall events in exchange for money, fame, and tickets to &quot;paradise&quot;. Will they succeed, and what dark secrets will be revealed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned Features (evolving):</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arsenal of manufactured weapons from Warsaw Pact and NATO</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arsenal of makeshift weapons that can be customized and upgraded</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple companion system with item-sharing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded skills system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded survival stats including body heat management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded crafting</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Venture deeper into the vast Tunguska Exclusion Zone. Challenge deadlier mutants and heavily-armed Predators. Survive the perils of extreme cold and other-worldly beings. Get ready to embark on a journey searching for dark secrets and a life beyond.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536500/24f70bca4fe76e88b278990cd277bcdca17401e4/header.jpg?t=1770457282", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536500/b5f4e42de5f09b44276a8df55e434ebc8fe45117/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770457282", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536500/b5f4e42de5f09b44276a8df55e434ebc8fe45117/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770457282", "website": "https://tunguskagame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8, 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li>